    "detailed_description": "<strong>...what if we mixed Space Invaders and Zelda's Boss Fights...!?</strong><br><br><strong>Short Story:</strong><br>They are coming. Ready your weapons. Get behind that wall. SHOOT. ... AND RUN!!<br><br><strong>Short Description: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use attacks and skills: Use different characters with different attacks and skills! <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/719258029b63f6d68a1ba02260ed512d.poster.avif?t=1620956327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/719258029b63f6d68a1ba02260ed512d.webm?t=1620956327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/719258029b63f6d68a1ba02260ed512d.mp4?t=1620956327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Dodge: Skillfully evade, block or explode enemies' attacks before they reach you. <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/213e9ab272db5155b1f91d9e3201df8a.poster.avif?t=1620956327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/213e9ab272db5155b1f91d9e3201df8a.webm?t=1620956327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/213e9ab272db5155b1f91d9e3201df8a.mp4?t=1620956327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Recruit Allies: Don't fight alone! Allies will help you when you need the most!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/2fbb4c0cdd520479d154d4af6959f272.poster.avif?t=1620956327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/2fbb4c0cdd520479d154d4af6959f272.webm?t=1620956327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/2fbb4c0cdd520479d154d4af6959f272.mp4?t=1620956327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Interact with the environment: Sometimes the best solution is just to return whatever they throw at you.<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/68747773b096c3635d6ae1eab91e4e76.poster.avif?t=1620956327\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/68747773b096c3635d6ae1eab91e4e76.webm?t=1620956327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1525390/extras/68747773b096c3635d6ae1eab91e4e76.mp4?t=1620956327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul><br><strong>Story:</strong><br>After years of battle, the Tree of Eternity was damaged by a big attack from the Demon Lord, at the cost of his own (resurrectable) life.<br>Still, the Undead and other chaos creatures are here believing they can give the final blow.<br>Other living races, watching how the Tree of Eternity is damaged, are trying to capture the fortress, believing they can do a better job on defending the Tree than the current defenders.<br>You, the Eternal Protector, are here to prove all of them are wrong.<br><br><strong>Gameplay: </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The Eternity Protectors is a 20 minutes session Hero Defense. You play as a single Protector, shooting arrows and summoning magic to banish all creatures trying to invade the Eternity Fortress;<br></li><li> Play and unlock many Protectors to defend the Tree of Eternity;<br></li><li> Become stronger by defeating bosses and freeing souls of Heroes;<br></li><li> Defeat the invaders Summoners to destroy the barrier protecting the invader Boss;<br></li><li> Interact with the environment by putting trees on fire, shooting at enemies projectiles, throwing bombs back... and many more;<br></li><li> THE GAME HAS NO TEXT. Learn the game by playing and sharing knowledge with the community. There is no &quot;How to survive an entire world's invasion&quot; guidebook.</li></ul>",
