nd freeing souls of Heroes;<br></li><li> Defeat the invaders Summoners to destroy the barrier protecting the invader Boss;<br></li><li> Interact with the environment by putting trees on fire, shooting at enemies projectiles, throwing bombs back... and many more;<br></li><li> THE GAME HAS NO TEXT. Learn the game by playing and sharing knowledge with the community. There is no &quot;How to survive an entire world's invasion&quot; guidebook.</li></ul>",
